<div id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For ROUGE score computations, we used the implementation from <a href="https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/rouge" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/google-research/google-research/tree/master/rouge</a>, released under Apache 2.0 license. BERTScore was computed using the package <a href="https://pypi.org/project/bert-score/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://pypi.org/project/bert-score/</a> and is released under a MIT license. BLANC using <a href="https://pypi.org/project/blanc/" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://pypi.org/project/blanc/</a>, released under a MIT license.</p>
</div>
