<p id="A7.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our code is based on Pytorch <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Paszke et al., 2019</a>)</cite>, Huggingface <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib39" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wolf et al. (2020)</a></cite> and H3 <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">Fu et al. (2023)</a></cite>. LongT5, LED models and weights are released under the Apache 2.0 license. The license for the LSG model and weights is unknown.</p>
